<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Event Registration and Schedule</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:green;color:#243047;line-height:1.6}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123b68,#2877a8);color:white;text-align:center;padding:45px 20px}
header h1{font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:10px}
nav{background:yellow;text-align:center;padding:12px}
nav a{color:maroon;text-decoration:none;margin:0 14px;font-weight:bold}
nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
main{max-width:1050px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 18px}
section{background:white;padding:25px;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #142d4b14}
h2{color:#174f7a;margin-bottom:15px}
.event-details{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
.detail{background:#eaf3fb;border-left:4px solid #2877a8;padding:12px 15px;flex:1 1 190px;border-radius:5px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px}
th,td{padding:13px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #dce3ec}
th{background:#174f7a;color:white}
tr:nth-child(even){background:#f5f8fc}
form{display:grid;gap:14px}
label{font-weight:bold}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #b9c6d5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;margin-top:5px}
button{background:#19734a;color:white;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:13px 18px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
button:hover{background:#125c39}
#confirmation{display:none;margin-top:15px;padding:12px;background:#e5f6eb;color:#145b32;border-radius:6px}
footer{background:#0d2947;color:white;text-align:center;padding:20px;margin-top:35px}

.video-container{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:850px;margin:18px auto 0;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#111;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.video-container video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:#000}
@media(max-width:650px){header h1{font-size:1.7rem}nav a{display:inline-block;margin:5px 8px}section{padding:18px}table{font-size:.88rem}th,td{padding:8px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>WELCOME TO FUAAMOTU DAY EVENT 2026</h1>
<p>Connect • Celebrate • Share • Feast</p>
<p>Join us for a day of celabration, fun, and community activities!</p>
<img src="fuaamotu.jpg" style="width:50%; height:2%;">
</header>
<nav>
<a href="#about">About</a><a href="#event-video">Event Video</a><a href="#schedule">Schedule</a><a href="#register">Register</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section id="about">
<h2>About the Event</h2>
<p>Welcome to Fua'amotu Day!

Fua'amotu Day is a special occasion for our community to come together, celebrate our culture, share our talents, and strengthen the bonds that unite us.
 This exciting event provides an opportunity for families, friends, and community members to enjoy fun activities, traditional performances,food,and entertainment. 
 It is also a time to appreciate our community's identity, promote unity, and create beautiful memories together. Everyone is welcome to join us for a day filled with joy, laughter, and community spirit.
 Let's celebrate Fua'amotu and make this day unforgettable!!</p>
<div class="event-details">
<div class="detail"><strong>Date:</strong><br>21 November 2026</div>
<div class="detail"><strong>Time:</strong><br>9:00 AM – 3:00 PM</div>
<div class="detail"><strong>Location:</strong><br>Hoosi Tea, Fua'amotu</div>
<div class="detail"><strong>Entry:</strong><br>Free</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="event-video">
<h2>Watch Our Event Video</h2>
<p>Enjoy this video and get ready to celebrate Fua'amotu Day!</p>
<div class="video-container">
  <video controls playsinline preload="metadata">
    <source src="fuaamotu-event-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    Your browser does not support HTML5 video. Please use a current version of Chrome or Edge.
  </video>
</div>
</section>
<section id="schedule">
<h2>Event Schedule</h2><p>Here is the plan for the day.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Activity</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>9:00 AM</td><td>Registration</td><td>Welcome and check-in</td></tr>
<tr><td>9:30 AM</td><td>Opening Ceremony</td><td>Welcome speech and prayer</td></tr>
<tr><td>10:00 AM</td><td>Learning Workshop</td><td>Team learning activities</td></tr>
<tr><td>12:00 PM</td><td>Lunch Break</td><td>Food and refreshments</td></tr>
<tr><td>1:00 PM</td><td>Games and Activities</td><td>Fun group challenges</td></tr>
<tr><td>2:30 PM</td><td>Closing Ceremony</td><td>Thank-you messages and farewell</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
<section id="register">
<h2>Event Registration Form</h2><p>Complete the form below to register for the event.</p>
<form id="registrationForm">
<div><label for="fullname">Full Name</label><input type="text" id="fullname" name="fullname" placeholder="Enter your full name" required></div>
<div><label for="email">Email Address</label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required></div>
<div><label for="phone">Phone Number</label><input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Enter your phone number" required></div>
<div><label for="attendance">How will you attend?</label><select id="attendance" name="attendance" required><option value="">Choose an option</option><option value="In person">In person</option><option value="Online">Online</option></select></div>
<div><label for="message">Questions or Comments (optional)</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Write a message here"></textarea></div>
<button type="submit">Register Now</button>
</form>
<p id="confirmation" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>
</main>
<footer><p>&copy; 2026 Fuaamotu Day | Event Registration Website</p></footer>
<script>
const form = document.getElementById("registrationForm");
const confirmation = document.getElementById("confirmation");
form.addEventListener("submit", function(event) {
  event.preventDefault();
  const name = document.getElementById("fullname").value.trim();
  confirmation.textContent = "Thank you, " + name + "! Your form has been completed. This demo does not send or save registrations.";
  confirmation.style.display = "block";
  form.reset();
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
